BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20261128-en@floumallorca.com
DTSTAMP:20261108T190000Z
DTSTART:20261128T093000Z
DTEND:20261128T183000Z
SUMMARY:💥 FLOU REFLEXIÓN · Ecstatic Dance Mallorca
LOCATION:TANA Mallorca BioHub\, Carretera S'Esglaieta Santa Maria km 1.3\, 
 07110 Buñola\, Mallorca
DESCRIPTION:PROGRAM\n\n10:30 We open the doors 🚪\n11:00 Opening circle 
 ✨\n11:15 – 11:45 Awakening the FLOU\, with Asia 🦋\n11:45 Ecstatic D
 ance with DJ Cactus 🌵💃🕺\n13:45 Break and lunch with Beldi - Habib
 i Food 🥗\n14:00 – 15:00 Acroyoga and Circus workshop for kids 🎪
 🤸\n15:00 Cacao medicine and heart songs with Carlos Marcús and Jesús 
 Jota 💜\n16:30 – 17:00 Awakening the FLOU\, with Asia 🦋\n17:00 Ecst
 atic Dance with DJ Belen Pacifico 🕺💃\n19:00 Sound bath with Carlos M
 arcús and Subagh. Integration and closing 🔔\n19:30 End ✨\n\n🌳 Mag
 ic mini forest for the whole family\n💧🍇 Free water and fruit through
 out the event\n🪔 Artisan market\, massages and Wellness Corner all day 
 long 🌿\n\nBefore the general elections\, a day of dance and reflection 
 is needed. Fewer speeches and more movement. VOTE FLOU!\n\nOnline tickets 
 from €20. At the door: all day €30\, from 3 pm €20. Kids €5 at the
  door (magic forest\, sensory trail\, crafts\, circus workshop and games).
 \n\nMore info: https://www.floumallorca.com/en/\nTickets: https://brainpas
 .com/flou/flou-reflexion
URL:https://www.floumallorca.com/en/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
